x &= \sqrt{ \frac{b^2 - 3ac}{4a^3} }
y &= \frac{1}{3x^2} + \sqrt{ \frac{b}{2a^3} x - \frac{c}{2a^4} }
z &= \frac{2y}{ y^3 - \frac{b}{3a^2} } \numberthis \label{z}
\end{align*}
$$
(see https://brilliant.org/wiki/cubic-ferrari-method-hand-calculation/. Here we have $a = 1$, $b = 0$, $c = 1$.)

Now solve step-by-step:
