\end{align*}

The argument $\theta$ of root $z$ is in the interval $[90^\circ, 180^\circ]$ if and only if $90^\circ \leq \arg(z) \leq 180^\circ$. To check this, consider the exponential form of $z$ which relates argument to imaginary part:
